From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] spi: dw-mmio: make the k230 per-source interrupts optional

dw_spi_canaan_k230_init() reads one interrupt per source and stops at
the first one missing. Use platform_get_irq_optional() so that a node
with fewer interrupts does not log an error for the missing ones.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/spi/spi-dw-mmio.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/spi/spi-dw-mmio.c b/drivers/spi/spi-dw-mmio.c
index 21782006f..5a43b36f9 100644
--- a/drivers/spi/spi-dw-mmio.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-dw-mmio.c
@@ -278,7 +278,7 @@ static int dw_spi_canaan_k230_init(struct platform_device *pdev,
 	dwsmmio->dws.ip = DW_HSSI_ID;
 	dwsmmio->dws.caps = DW_SPI_CAP_INDEP_IRQ;
 	for (i = 1; i < ARRAY_SIZE(dwsmmio->dws.irqs); i++) {
-		irq = platform_get_irq(pdev, i);
+		irq = platform_get_irq_optional(pdev, i);
 		if (irq < 0)
 			return 0;
 		dwsmmio->dws.irqs[i - 1] = irq;
-- 
2.43.0

